    "updated_at": "2026-11-16T19:13:46Z",
    "body": "Thank you again for this report. It is fixed in `main` by PR #2205.\n\nWhen the exit point of a closed 2D Contour overlaps past a rounded corner, the overlap now follows the same lines and arcs as the contour. The crossing check stays on, and it no longer finds crossings on this path, so the post goes through.\n\nThe fix ships in the next release (v0.23.0). You can test it now with a build from `main`.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
